---
title: PROPOSED v2 - Seller Unit row states (listing_status) - mirror of the buyer Interest row
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    state "Pricing Requested<br/>(like buyer: Requested)" as PR
    state "Price Proposed<br/>(like buyer: Offer Sent)" as PP
    state "Listed<br/>(matchable - Unit status Available)" as LI
    state "Verification Due<br/>(3-month check open)" as VD
    state "Off Market<br/>(temporarily unavailable)" as OM
    state "Under Contract<br/>(buyer Interest in Closing - Unit Reserved)" as UC
    state "Sold<br/>(contract signed - Unit Sold)" as SO
    state "Withdrawn<br/>(declined / sold elsewhere / stopped)" as WD

    [*] --> LI: Add Property - owner sets price
    [*] --> PR: Add Property - owner asks agent to price

    PR --> PP: Agent Pricing submitted
    PP --> LI: Price Decision - accept or own price
    PP --> PR: Price Decision - re-price
    PP --> WD: Price Decision - declines

    LI --> VD: 3-month verification action becomes due
    LI --> PR: Update - owner asks re-pricing
    LI --> OM: Update - temporarily unavailable
    LI --> WD: Update - withdrawn / sold elsewhere

    VD --> LI: Verified available (same or new owner price)
    VD --> PR: Available - needs re-pricing
    VD --> OM: Temporarily unavailable
    VD --> WD: Withdrawn / sold elsewhere

    OM --> LI: Follow-up call - available again
    OM --> WD: Follow-up call - withdrawn

    LI --> UC: Buyer Begin Closing (existing)
    VD --> UC: Buyer Begin Closing (existing)
    UC --> LI: Closing abandoned (existing release)
    UC --> SO: Contract signed - Closed Won (existing)

    WD --> PR: Sales Manager reactivation only
    WD --> LI: Sales Manager reactivation - owner sets price
    SO --> [*]
